id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set\\text{-}successor\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSetSuccessorSet}_S(s,x)\\leftrightarrow s=x\\cup\\{x\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set\\text{-}successor\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSetSuccessorSet}_S(s,x)\\leftrightarrow s=x\\cup\\{x\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the von Neumann successor operation on arbitrary sets; for ordinals it agrees with ordinal successor.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x,s\\in V$ (sets, see [[../batch12/58-df-set.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x,s\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\{x\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\cup\\{x\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSetSuccessorSet}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set\\text{-}successor\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSetSuccessorSet}_S(s,x)\\leftrightarrow s=x\\cup\\{x\\}","display":true}],"bytes":817,"backlinks":[{"id":"23ce5bf0d5ec59e3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_